%0AAll+five+foundational+assumptions+remain.%0A%0A%23%23+Novelty%2C+exact+sources+and+reproduction%0A%0ABase%3A+%60e54523517d0f03e58352e647c403a5af3e525a57%60.+SOURCES.json+binds+eleven%0Alive+inputs+by+Git+blob+and+SHA256+and+retains+historical+selected%2Fcard%0Aprovenance.+The+package+extends+%235814%27s+one-provider+ownership+theorem%2C%0A%235829%27s+whole-high+V%2FL+geometry+and+%235404%27s+historical-tape+accounting.%0A%236719%2F%236737%E2%80%93%236740%2C+%236879%2C+%236903+and+%236896+retain+their+distinct+physical%0Ashape%2C+helper%2C+chronological-field+and+capacity+results%3B+none+is+republished%0Aas+a+new+theorem.+The+related+stock%2FAPI+questions+in+%232343%2F%234432%2F%234957%0Aare+explicitly+distinguished+in+OVERLAP.md.%0A%0A%60%60%60sh%0Apython3+-B+scripts%2Fresearch_package.py+--package+research%2Fstratified-owned-reserves%0A%60%60%60%0A%0AExpected%3A+%60PASS_STRATIFIED_OWNED_RESERVES%60+twice%2C%0A%60PASS_STRATIFIED_BOUNDARIES%60%2C+%60PASS_INDEPENDENT_STRATIFIED_SPACE%60+twice%2C%0Aand+%60PASS_REGISTERED_RESEARCH_PACKAGE%60.%0ACPython+3.12%2C+standard+library+only.%0A%0AThe+exact+finite+evidence+covers+512+stage+graphs%2C+12%2C384+independently%0Aenumerated+bounded+paths%2C+a+31-node+restored-origin+history%2C+60%2C600%0Asmaller-width+stock+comparisons+and+118+complete+product+coordinates.%0ASeparate+subprocess+controls+reject+source+drift%2C+typed+receipt+corruption%0Aand+omitted+radix+inflation%2C+including+under+optimization.+The+written%0Ainduction+supplies+the+universal+lemma%3B+finite+checks+corroborate+it.%0AExecuted+checks+and+scope+are+recorded+in+VALIDATION.md+and+RESULT.json.%0A%0AA+separate+research+worker+independently+reviewed+the+mathematical%2Fsource%0Ainterfaces+and+supplied+a+different+exact+checker%3A+complete+descending+paths%0Awith+geometric+terminal+rewards+and+finite+dual+witnesses.+Normal+and%0Aoptimized+checks+pass+1%2C068+coordinate+certificates%2C+4%2C920+descending+paths%0Aand+four+controls.+The+source%2Fstock%2Fhistory+review+and+reviewed+core+hashes%0Aare+included+under+independent-review%3B+this+is+AI-assisted+review%2C+not+human%0Aor+formal-kernel+acceptance.%0A%0A%23%23+Remaining+obligations+and+credit%0A%0AThe+exact+%60.0034%60+all-history+space+contract%2C+actual+local+coefficients%2C%0Aemitted+numerical+dispatcher%2C+source+width+maxima%2C+root+stock+fit+and%0Acommon+physical+precision+layout+remain+to+be+supplied.+No+actual+cell%0Atariff%2C+complete+runtime%2C+unconditional+multiplication+theorem%2C+independent%0Ahuman+acceptance+or+formal-kernel+proof+is+asserted.%0A%0APrepared+for+%2A%2A%40CubeJerry%2A%2A+with+substantial+OpenAI+Codex+assistance+in%0Aderivation%2C+source+audit%2C+implementation+and+checking.+Credit+the+cited%0Apredecessors%2C+Jose+Manuel%2Fjmbarrancoml%27s+ordinary+and+stock+interfaces%2C+and%0Athe+native%2C+delayed-cover%2C+compiler%2C+frame+and+precision+lineage+retained%0Aby+the+selected+application.+New+work+is+Apache-2.0%3B+predecessor+files+and%0Athe+selected+certificate+remain+unchanged.%0A",
